{
  "run_id": "PMC12941970__expert_context__web_trend_niche_ground_b_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is addition of approximately 1–2 at.% Ag to CoCrFeNi during alloy synthesis.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Minor Ag doping will cause Ag to segregate to the sliding interface.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interfacial Ag will oxidize in air to form a continuous silver-oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting silver-oxide layer will be lubricious.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silver-oxide film will reduce interfacial shear strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silver-oxide film will minimize adhesive and abrasive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ag-doped CoCrFeNi will have a lower coefficient of friction than undoped CoCrFeNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12692809::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ag-doped CoCrFeNi will have a lower wear rate than undoped CoCrFeNi.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::011::remarkable_wear_resistance_and_wear_mech",
        "PMC12692809::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The friction and wear improvements will persist throughout 25–800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::011::remarkable_wear_resistance_and_wear_mech"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will remain effective under both low and high sliding loads in air.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention may be less effective in inert or reducing environments because Ag oxidation would be limited.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Undoped CoCrFeNi has suboptimal and temperature-dependent tribological performance over the proposed operating range.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The friction and wear rates of undoped CoCrFeNi increase with temperature, load, and environmental influences.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A NiX alloy maintained wear rates on the order of 10^-7 to 10^-6 mm3/Nm from room temperature to 800 °C.",
      "field": "supporting_evidence_ids",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::011::remarkable_wear_resistance_and_wear_mech"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Y2O3 additions to a Ni-based complex-concentrated-alloy coating reduced average friction coefficient and mass loss and mitigated abrasive and adhesive wear.",
      "field": "supporting_evidence_ids",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12692809::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis would be falsified if Ag doping produced no statistically significant friction and wear reduction across at least three temperature intervals, or if no segregated continuous silver-oxide film were detected.",
